## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical end-to-end design for ingestion, validation, idempotency, and observability. It also probes cost-conscious choices and simple rollback strategies.

## Key Concepts
- GCS multi-env isolation; signed URLs; Dataflow Batch; BigQuery partitions; file checksums; anomaly detection; Cloud Monitoring alerts.

## Code Example
